            "sha256": "839785443ba44741625d5a28517994a7c24e153f87353b0ab4f4859a3542f5ff"
          },
          "tex": "From now on we will study only finite-dimensional vector spaces.\nIn the rest of this book we shall take `vector space' to mean \n`finite-dimensional vector space'.",
          "source_file": {
            "path": "src/vs/vs3.tex",
